<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2015/06/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>dojo</id>
    <title>dojo</title>
    <version>$version$</version>
    <authors>Dojo Maintainers</authors>
    <owners>Jamie Stormbreaker</owners>
    <summary>A simple, flexible way to build, deploy, and manage cloud native applications</summary>
    <description>
Dojo centers application configuration, management, and behavior around the application itself, not the infrastructure that the app runs on.

Dojo provides automation that can programmatically and declaratively build, deploy, and manage your application and services, both stateful and stateless.

Dojo can be deployed and run on various infrastructure environments including bare metal, VM, containers, and PaaS. 
    </description>
    <projectUrl>https://github.com/Strip-Mall-Karate/dojo</projectUrl>
    <projectSourceUrl>https://github.com/Strip-Mall-Karate/dojo</projectSourceUrl>
    <bugTrackerUrl>https://github.com/Strip-Mall-Karate/dojo/issues</bugTrackerUrl>
    <tags>dojo</tags>
